.TH NN-LINT 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-lint \- static correctness and quality checks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn lint [options] <model>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Graph and tensor sanity checks without executing the model.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 no errors; 9 if errors present.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn lint model.onnx
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-inspect(1), nn-validate(1)
